## Upstream material

This project derives material from the following upstream works. Licences are
stated as verified for the versions actually used; the SPDX-JSON SBOM attached to
each GitHub release names the complete dependency inventory of the released
binary.

| Upstream work | Licence | What is derived | Distribution |
|---|---|---|---|
| HashiCorp `terraform-provider-scaffolding-framework` | MPL-2.0 | Entry point (`main.go`) and the provider build/serve pattern | Source and binary |
| `caberdo/terraform-provider-gravitino` | Apache-2.0 | CI, release and coverage workflow configuration only; no Go source code taken | Repository configuration only, not compiled into the binary |
| HashiCorp Terraform plugin libraries | MPL-2.0 | `terraform-plugin-framework`, `terraform-plugin-framework-validators`, `terraform-plugin-go`, `terraform-plugin-log` and `terraform-plugin-testing` are compiled into the provider and its tests; `terraform-plugin-docs` is used at build time to generate `docs/` | Binary and build tooling |
| `github.com/trinodb/trino-go-client` | Apache-2.0 | Trino client protocol implementation used by the statement executor | Binary |
| `github.com/jcmturner/gokrb5/v8` | Apache-2.0 | Kerberos SPNEGO authentication, arriving through `trino-go-client` | Binary |

The published identifiers are the Go module path
`github.com/caberdo/terraform-provider-trino` and the Terraform Registry
namespace `registry.terraform.io/caberdo/trino`; the source repository is
<https://github.com/caberdo/terraform-provider-trino>.

## Third-party dependencies

The complete dependency inventory, with versions and licences, is listed in the
SPDX-JSON SBOM generated by `anchore/sbom-action` in `.github/workflows/release.yml`
and attached to every GitHub release.

Trino itself is not included in this distribution; the provider talks to a Trino
coordinator over the client protocol.
